  "job_B9.2.7_20251003_115004": {
    "chunk_text": "his sunu feng to \u00fe\u00e6m onwalde, he \u00fea hr\u00e6dlice forlet \u00fea burg \u00fee he Ac \u00fea hit se sunu anfunde, \u00fea adr\u00e6fde he \u00feone f\u00e6der. & he fleah on Gallie, & wolde Constantinus beswican his a\u00feum, & habban him \u00fe\u00e6t rice. Ac hit anfunde his dohtor, & hit Constantinuse as\u00e6de, & he hiene afliemde si\u00fe\u00fean on Masiliam; \u00dea gesealde Galerius Lucinuse Italiam & Affricam; & he het ealle \u00fea cristnan \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6r betste \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m he wear\u00f0 on micelre untrumnesse, & him to gehet monigne l\u00e6ce. & heora nan him ne mehte bion nane gode. Ac him s\u00e6de heora an \u00fe\u00e6t hit w\u00e6re Godes wracu. \u00dea het he \u00fe\u00e6t mon \u00fea cristnan eft gebrohte on heora earde, \u00e6lcne \u00fe\u00e6r he \u00e6r w\u00e6s; swa \u00feeah he \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m wera\u00fe gewinn betuh Constantinuse & Maxentiuse, & ra\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6s Constantinus ofslog On \u00fe\u00e6m dagum Maximinus bebead cristenra monna ehtnesse, & ra\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6s gefor on Tharsa \u00fe\u00e6re On \u00fe\u00e6m dagum Lucinius bebead \u00fe\u00e6t nan cristen mon ne come on his hierede ne on his f\u00e6relte. & ra\u00fee \u00fe\u00e6s wear\u00f0 gewin betuh him & betuh Constantinuse & oftr\u00e6dlica gefeoht, o\u00fe On \u00fe\u00e6m d\u00e6gum Arrius se m\u00e6ssepresbyter wear\u00fe on gedwolan ymb \u00feone ryhtan geleafan. Ymb \u00feone timan w\u00e6s gegaderad III hund biscepa & eahtatiene, hiene to oferflitanne & to On \u00fe\u00e6m dagum Constantinus ofslog Crispum his sunu, &",
